xiaomi-mipps-auth (0.21-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of the MiPPS/PPS charger authentication daemon
    (upstream ianchb/xiaomi-mipps-auth 0.21, authored for Xiaomi Pad 6S Pro
    12.4 / sheng). Requires the qcom_battmgr MiPPS hooks (request_vdm_cmd
    sysfs interface) shipped as a patch in linux-redmi-marble 7.2.8+marble6.

